; A US (ANSI or ISO) keyboard: digits and letters by their legend, Y and Z where they are written on the keys, the
; accented letters on the punctuation keys (Í on `, Ö on -, Ü on =, Ő on [, Ú on ], Ű on \, É on ;, Á on '), Ó on TAB
; and on the ISO key left of Z; the rest as hungarian.keys says.
